display_name = "Grounding Surge"
description = "You ground yourself for {b:GROUNDING_SURGE_TIME} sec: you cannot move, your abilities cost {b:GROUNDING_SURGE_COST_PCT}% less Energy, and an ability that spends all your Energy counts as spending all of it but leaves you {b:GROUNDING_SURGE_KEEP_PCT}% of it. Use it again to end it early. Not on the global cooldown."
